                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "80185419-b4d5-3095-9209-08992af61427",
                                        "entry_id": "c79f4832-7920-380b-91df-8ac14a005ec1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A natural attraction or feeling of kinship to a person or thing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc1e6935-9fbf-3762-9fc8-e08d307843b1",
                                        "entry_id": "c79f4832-7920-380b-91df-8ac14a005ec1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A family relationship through marriage of a relative (e.g. sister-in-law), as opposed to consanguinity (e.g. sister)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1023dff9-c726-3eb3-b391-b37ee221231e",
                                        "entry_id": "c79f4832-7920-380b-91df-8ac14a005ec1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A kinsman or kinswoman of a such relationship; one who is affinal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7e39f629-53a0-3475-a75a-ffaa0bc48c6d",
                                        "entry_id": "c79f4832-7920-380b-91df-8ac14a005ec1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The fact of and manner in which something is related to another."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4fa60d8-0f68-41a6-8c88-4c015f673437",
                                                "sense_id": "7e39f629-53a0-3475-a75a-ffaa0bc48c6d",
                                                "text": "There are, of course, certain differences of detail; for example, the placing of the safety valves on the boiler barrel behind the dome, which follows the practice in the Riddles 2-8-0 and 2-10-0 locomotives for the Ministry of Supply; but taken all in all, Britannia's boiler has a closer affinity with the Doncaster designs than with any other."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "505c4215-320e-41aa-8aa9-81149ff26be4",
                                                "sense_id": "7e39f629-53a0-3475-a75a-ffaa0bc48c6d",
                                                "text": "A “signature” was placed on all things by God to indicate their affinities — but it was hidden, hence the search for arcane knowledge. Knowing was guessing and interpreting, not observing or demonstrating."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dddced84-bcd8-3b40-a9c8-c98b093973b9",
                                        "entry_id": "c79f4832-7920-380b-91df-8ac14a005ec1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any romantic relationship."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7444fec2-8964-3dcd-a049-f694de84267f",
                                        "entry_id": "c79f4832-7920-380b-91df-8ac14a005ec1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A love interest; a paramour."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a8282c8-e508-4a26-8506-54c013d5b79a",
                                                "sense_id": "7444fec2-8964-3dcd-a049-f694de84267f",
                                                "text": "\"Cut it short, sis, cut it short,\" he would growl at her if she started to murmur sweet \"coo-coos\" to her affinity stationed on the other end of the wire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7935a7ff-aa43-3e16-8e37-88abe1868c9b",
                                        "entry_id": "c79f4832-7920-380b-91df-8ac14a005ec1",
                                        "glosses": [
